Deferred destinations: asymptotic-energy and radiation-power mathematics for ADM/Bondi/quadrupole; rigorous black-hole theorem module for Birkhoff global scope, singularity/area/no-hair and uniqueness; separate electrovacuum Kerr/RN module for charge/gauge conventions; primary-experiment analysis modules for SR12/GR12. Quantum/semiclassical Hawking, graviton, entropy, quantum matter and reconciliation claims are out of scope because they require independent framework postulates and mathematical machinery.

## Personally checked source arguments and critical integration

The scaffolder personally read (not merely the reader summaries): Tong §§3.2.3 pp108–110, §3.4 pp130–132, §4.1 pp141–145, §§4.5.2–3 pp183–184, §5.1.2 pp209–210; Carroll Levi–Civita pp59–60, Bianchi pp80–81 and weak/slow/Newtonian field pp105–112; Crowell pp23–28,31,36–37,60–68; Reall §§2.1–2.3 pp25–30, §3.4 pp39–40, §4.2 pp41–42. Selected formula extractions were inspected directly. This is bounded load-bearing reading, not a claim this scaffolder reread all four complete texts.

These readings motivated explicit nondegenerate M05 instead of consuming a positive-definite Riemannian theorem, restricted flat M02 instead of trusting curved maximality prose, precise affine-chart versus tetrad/congruence definitions, signed curvature conventions and c restoration. Tong's determinant log argument requires branch caution for Lorentzian matrices: G4–G5 supply the local adjugate/Jacobi determinant proof, not an unrestricted real matrix logarithm. Source equations count as conditional calculations; neither covariance nor Newtonian matching proves the Einstein postulate. Matter divergence requires equations of motion. All four completed reports were read and integrated before finalization. Crowell additionally exposes incorrect congruence normalization and DEC/EM formulas; hence raw EM/rigidity statements are not harvested. Reall explicitly leaves Lorentz-generator commutators as an ellipsis and omits full Schwarzschild/cosmology/solar-test treatment; these omissions do not count as independent topic coverage. Reader reports retain all detected source errata; no invalid formula is silently harvested.

## Current audit and expansion

The 2026-10-03 owner audit adds complete [SR supplier arguments](sr-supplier-proofs.md), [Lorentzian geometry/variation/matter arguments](gr-local-proofs.md), [explicit solutions and controlled approximations](gr-solution-proofs.md), and [causal/extremality arguments](gr-causal-proofs.md). SR now supplies Classical EM through the agreed [supplier contract](../sr-em-supplier-contract.json), including the exact two-form sign map. EM's pure mathematical all-space Kirchhoff/Duhamel supplier returns to GR harmonic gauge without a physical prerequisite cycle.

Completed additions include Lorentz group/Lie algebra and smooth affine-isometry classification; observer velocity/acceleration, radar/Doppler/aberration, clock extremality and signaling; nondegenerate metric connection, tensor differentiation, normal charts, signed Bianchi, Jacobi; compact EH/particle/scalar variations, conservation, dust/fluid/energy conditions; Schwarzschild vacuum/horizon/orbit/redshift, FLRW models, linearized waves and uniform weak/slow finite-region error estimates; local timelike maximum before conjugacy, Minkowski Cauchy proof, explicit flat global countermodels and local focusing. Exact definitions, domains, units and argument hypotheses travel with each named interface.

[closure-ledger.json](../closure-ledger.json) preserves every M01–M26 interface and its exact hypotheses. Advanced closure is supplied by [einstein-pde-proofs.md](einstein-pde-proofs.md) E0–E3 and [global-lorentz-proofs.md](global-lorentz-proofs.md) H0–H4: high-regularity symmetric hyperbolic evolution, reduced Einstein/selected-matter equations, data/constraints/subsidiary/geometric uniqueness, Cauchy equivalence and smooth splitting, and the checked external smooth MGHD proof. S11 supplies smooth rigidity classification; Q4 adds scaled convergence/stress hierarchy and Q5 the full Kruskal model/local Birkhoff proof. Scalar wave or Riemannian statements were not substituted for these Lorentzian/nonlinear proofs. Exact external proof statuses and actual bounded readings are recorded in the advanced source directory.

Actual local checks, source/supplier inspections and remaining exact deficits are in [audit-expansion-report.md](../audit-expansion-report.md). Independent source-coverage shortfalls and primary-report research destinations above remain accurately disclosed. No measurements, full-text reread, independent audit, production items/plans, engine transition or publication are invented.
